8: # Quarkus TDD Workflow
9: 
10: TDD guidance for Quarkus 3.x services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration). Optimized for event-driven architectures with Apache Camel.
11: 
12: ## When to Use
13: 
14: - New features or REST endpoints
15: - Bug fixes or refactors
16: - Adding data access logic, security rules, or reactive streams
17: - Testing Apache Camel routes and event handlers
18: - Testing event-driven services with RabbitMQ
19: - Testing conditional flow logic
20: - Validating CompletableFuture async operations
21: - Testing LogContext propagation
22: 
23: ## Workflow
24: 
25: 1. Write tests first (they should fail)
26: 2. Implement minimal code to pass
27: 3. Refactor with tests green
28: 4. Enforce coverage with JaCoCo (80%+ target)
